/E (Sheth Varjivandas Madhavdas Kapol Boarding School Trust \(VMKB\), established in 1896, stands as a symbol of enduring values, commitment to education and community service. Founded by Sheth Shri Tribhovandas and Sheth Shri Jagmohandas in memory of their father, Sheth Shri Varjivandas Madhavdas, the institution reflects a rich legacy rooted in philanthropy and social upliftment.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
