/P 61 0 R
/E (The founding fathers of VMKB envisioned this institution as a place where bright students would be supported with the necessary facilities and infrastructure to achieve their academic goals. What began as a modest initiative with just seven students has today grown into a well-established institution accommodating over 100 students. Along with academic focus, the institution also encourages overall personality development. VMKB is widely appreciated for its contribution to the upliftment of both Kapol and non-Kapol students, and to society at large.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
